MACRO P                                                                         
  &P.WXTR3E-CTX                                           1    57 A             
*                                 PRIMARY EXTRACT                               
*                                                                               
*                                 PRICE CHECK (PP95)                            
*                                                                               
*                                 CREATED PER ORDERLINE WHEN                    
*                                 EMPTYING TRANSACTIONS                         
*                                 REGARDING PRICE-ERRORS                        
*                                                                               
    &P.IDPTYP                                             1     3 A             
*                                 RECORD TYPE                                   
    &P.IDMARKBO                                           4     1 A             
*                                 MARKET COMPANY CODE                           
*                                 A = VCS                                       
*                                 B = VCEM                                      
*                                 C = NORDIC WITHOUT SWEDEN                     
*                                 D = VCUK                                      
*                                 E = VCNA                                      
*                                 F = VCI                                       
*                                 G = VCAS                                      
    &P.IDDISTR                                            5     3 P  0          
*                                 DISTRICT NUMBER                               
    &P.IDKUNDNR                                           8     4 P  0          
*                                 CUSTOMER NO                                   
    &P.IDORDER                                           12     4 P  0          
*                                 VOLVO PARTS ORDER NUMBER                      
    &P.KDORDKL                                           16     1 P  0          
*                                 ORDER CLASS                                   
    &P.KDFAKTYP                                          17     1 A             
*                                 INVOICE TYPE                                  
    &P.IDARTNR                                           18     5 P  0          
*                                 PART NUMBER                                   
    &P.KDPRODSL                                          23     2 P  0          
*                                 PRODUCT GROUP                                 
    &P.IDFKNGRP                                          25     3 P  0          
*                                 FUNCTION GROUP                                
    &P.PRARTNTO                                          28     5 P  2          
*                                 NET PRICE EACH   (FOB NET)                    
    &P.KVBEART                                           33     4 P  0          
*                                 ORDERED QUANTITY                              
    &P.PRARTSJK                                          37     5 P  2          
*                                 COST OF SALES                                 
    &P.TIREGDAT                                          42     4 P  0          
*                                 REGISTRATION DATE (YYMMDD)                    
    &P.TIRODAT                                           46     4 P  0          
*                                 BACK ORDER DATE        (YYMMDD)               
    &P.PRBPRIS                                           50     5 P  2          
    &P.IDFELKOD                                          55     3 A             
*                                 ERROR CODE                                    
*** END COPY WXTR3E                  LENGTH =            57                     
